  "result": "Perfect! Now I have a clean, working converter. To generate the output, run this command from the locators directory:\n\n```bash\ncd /private/var/folders/q3/7qm6ld811lx1ndhcgbzpdjzh0000gn/T/locators-RBEEvK\npython3 final_convert.py\n```\n\nThis will create `output.json` with all conversions.\n\n**Summary of the conversion:**\n\nThe converter handles:\n- ✅ Simple type + attribute: `//XCUIElementTypeButton[@name=\"x\"]` → `-ios class chain:**/XCUIElementTypeButton[name == \"x\"]`\n- ✅ Contains predicates: `[contains(@name,\"x\")]` → `[name CONTAINS \"x\"]`\n- ✅ Index selection: `[1]` → `[INDEX==0]` (0-based)\n- ✅ Multiple AND predicates: `[@a=\"1\" and @b=\"2\"]` → `[a == \"1\", b == \"2\"]`\n- ✅ Comparison operators: `[@value>5]` → `[value > 5]`\n- ⏭️ Skips unsupported patterns:\n  - XPath axes (following::, preceding::, ancestor::)\n  - XPath functions (text(), translate(), string-join(), tokenize(), matches(), replace(), etc.)\n  - Union operator (|) and OR logic\n  - Parent navigation (..)\n  - Complex position predicates (last(), position()<=N)\n\nAll 678 locators will be converted, with skipped ones marked with `\"skip\": true` and a reason explaining why they couldn't be converted.",
